    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord-thieves.lua",
      "line": 4681,
      "source": "I ain't no chatting! Speak to the boss!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "我没空闲聊！去跟老大说！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "937bbae6bc7ce4651ad9aa88c9b0e9a72f73ff414d0d889c434e3013328f026c"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord-thieves.lua",
      "line": 4682,
      "source": "[leave]",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "[离开]",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "5d9d44ce0f6c744a4755d4933ae9f643516919bca4f6b1fe34ec071b43dfda22"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4687,
      "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#You and the Lord discuss your new relationship at some length, including the merits of assassination by proxy and some additional trapping techniques.",
      "source_tag": "log",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#你与盗贼领主详谈了你们的新关系，包括借刀杀人的益处以及一些额外的陷阱技巧。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "ab583eb29549df8114d5cb249be3eeedd452ec0fa1ea976319eeb7c268a1a008"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4688,
      "source": "As you depart the assassin lord says: 'And do not forget, I own you now.'",
      "source_tag": "log",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "当你离开时，盗贼领主说道：“别忘了，你现在归我所有了。”",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "f60a876b699c714bff6d392692cedbc9fe59005a3d359ff868b354aa754a159a"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4689,
      "source": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*Before you stands a menacing man clothed in black.*#WHITE#\nAhh, the intruder at last... And what shall we do with you? Why did you kill my men?",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "#LIGHT_GREEN#*在你面前站着一个身穿黑衣的凶恶男人。*#WHITE#\n啊，入侵者终于现身了……我们该怎么处置你呢？你为什么杀我的人？",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "4cbd8eff4bb5c1c7fa3248e2d01341bb8537837a55a17145c46f090328db9313"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4692,
      "source": "I heard some cries, and your men... they were in my way. What's going on here?",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "我听到了呼喊声，而你的人……挡了我的路。这里发生了什么事？",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "122af2e4a37d25eb1541faf2f351e7e08e5c0d951569ea43220d6cb3b2051510"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4693,
      "source": "I thought there might be some treasure to be had around here.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "我以为能在这里捞到些财宝。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "f649da466317ce7d06a0b7c02865b99a3ab507a1f855b5f3569c47fe5ff0520c"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4694,
      "source": "Sorry, I have to go!",
      "source_tag": "chat_assassin-lord",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "抱歉，我要走了！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "d703bdf247171166340d65acaf8d134a4cbed267b3ac687030087fefdb3a4c9c"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4695,
      "source": "Oh, you are not going anywhere, I'm afraid! KILL!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "哦，恐怕你哪儿也去不了！给我杀！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "813b5e9c6581cbe2522968474b9d220187de97c110febf1e600bc2715e17ce05"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4696,
      "source": "[attack]",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "[攻击]",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "c0b04311a7b383ca049e2abc33087b475bf42fa43e6e41504caa29a2c3238fa3"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4697,
      "source": "Wait! Maybe we could work out some kind of arrangement; you seem to be a practical man.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "等等！也许我们能达成某种协议；你看上去是个讲求实际的人。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "c1234d57ee9aa9e3a44715b864b2b67e2a745bf18464b3629b4c3ee5da1f6619"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4698,
      "source": "Oh, so this is the part where I tell you my plan before you attack me? GET THIS INTRUDER!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "哦，所以现在该轮到我在你动手前透露计划了？拿下这个入侵者！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "0ed388281ff298088ac5495a582def870e5acbb7ad2ba23c60b83438bf3ca261"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4699,
      "source": "I am afraid this is not your lucky day then. The merchant is ours... and so are you! GET THIS INTRUDER!!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "恐怕今天不是你的幸运日。那个商人是我们的了……你也是！拿下这个入侵者！！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "c79a8b0f120a0e48eb85ceab99b5b97e4766bfc7d27a25880ffefed6cd889c9a"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4700,
      "source": "Well, I need somebody to replace the men you killed. You look sturdy; maybe you could work for me.\nYou will have to do some dirty work for me, though, and you will be bound to me.  Nevertheless, you may make quite a profit from this venture, if you are as good as you seem to be.\nAnd do not think of crossing me.  That would be... unwise.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "好吧，我正需要有人来顶替被你杀掉的那些手下。你看上去挺结实；也许你能替我干活。\n不过，你得替我干些脏活，而且你将受制于我。话说回来，只要你的本事真有看上去那么过硬，你也能在这桩买卖中捞到不少好处。\n另外，可别动跟我作对的心思。那会……非常不明智。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "2f3e8e439ffe6d461d68560cb851be8450cb6b413bdbc03c7287e425af8224da"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4705,
      "source": "Well, I suppose it is better than dying.",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "好吧，我想总比送命强。",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "53be44bf1d162d4a774203526ccdef077168c0140a1f7e729a31f836dc72b69b"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4706,
      "source": "Money? I'm in!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "有钱赚？算我一个！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "3350dc218ee5b5e021788e006d145b649b540dfcf630f133be9032336b735ead"
    },
    {
      "section": "mod-tome/data/chats/assassin-lord.lua",
      "line": 4707,
      "source": "Just let me and the merchant get out of here and you may live!",
      "source_tag": "_t",
      "args_order": null,
      "target": "只要放我和商人离开这里，我就饶你不死！",
      "pinned_source_match": true,
      "revision_id": "c4aba14e6be59556cce42f37d82a3b5abc26a202fc4aa389dc314fe5e0889503"
    }
  ]
}
